## Methodology

Each target was assessed using:

1. **Reconnaissance** — Passive subdomain enumeration (subfinder / amass / assetfinder / CT logs / wayback), HTTP probing (httpx) and 3-round consolidation per the ars0n-framework-v2 pipeline. ROI scoring (per-URL prioritisation) follows the heuristics ported from `ROIReport.js → calculateROIScore()`.
2. **OWASP WSTG v4.2** — automated runners for {{ wstg_implemented }} of 97 tests; manual checklist stubs for the remainder.
3. **Bug Bounty Bootcamp** — chapter-aligned workflows for XSS (Ch.6), Open Redirect (Ch.7), Clickjacking (Ch.8), CSRF (Ch.9), IDOR (Ch.10), SQLi (Ch.11), SSRF (Ch.13), XXE (Ch.15), SSTI (Ch.16), Subdomain Takeover (Ch.20), Information Disclosure (Ch.21), API Hacking (Ch.24).
4. **Reporting** — Findings stored in SQLite at `~/.local/share/wpf/wpf.db`. This document is generated from that database.

